{"id":"n24586-3-7","stage":3,"title":"읽히다 · 被读","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24586-3-7-1","ko":"요즘 사람들에게 많이 읽히는 작품으로 뭐가 있지요?","zh":"最近大家都很喜欢读的著作有哪些呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들에게","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽히는","meaning":"被读","explanation":"읽히다：被读；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"읽히다","audio":"/audio/f8c82a47c70fc5d42042.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24586","senseId":"3","lemma":"읽히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작품으로","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"f8c82a47c70fc5d4","term":"읽히다","zh":"被读","audio":"/audio/f8c82a47c70fc5d42042.mp3","entryId":"24586","definition":"某个作家的作品被看到。","pronunciation":["일키다"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/90b9a27668b351e05d34.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24586-3-7-2","ko":"얼마 전에 돌아가신 법정 스님의 작품이 인기가 많습니다.","zh":"不久前圆寂的法顶大师的著作非常受欢迎。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌아가신","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"법정","meaning":"法顶（人名）","explanation":"법정：法顶（人名）","readings":[{"term":"법정","audio":"/audio/8126ae9f9120652f80a2.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"스님의","meaning":"僧人，大师","explanation":"스님：僧人，大师；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"스님","audio":"/audio/de061ffc44409a31f844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65320","senseId":"2","lemma":"스님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"작품이","meaning":"作品","explanation":"작품：作品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"작품","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24837","senseId":"2","lemma":"작품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많습니다.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"de061ffc44409a31","term":"스님","zh":"僧人，大师","audio":"/audio/de061ffc44409a31f844.mp3","entryId":"65320","definition":"(敬语)僧侣。","pronunciation":["스님"]},{"id":"eec1d8d2d561e94f","term":"작품","zh":"作品","audio":"/audio/eec1d8d2d561e94f9208.mp3","entryId":"24837","definition":"画、雕刻、小说、诗等通过艺术创作活动制成的东西。","pronunciation":["작품"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":